= Buttons in the slide

The buttons below are in the text of the slide, outside the frame.

<div class="controls">
<p>
<button data-demo-set="shape=ripple">Ripple</button>
<button data-demo-set="shape=waves">Waves</button>
<button data-demo-set="drop">Drop</button>
<button data-demo-set="ampl=0.25&amp;k=14">Strong</button>
</p>
<p>Amplitude: <span class="value" data-demo-value="ampl" data-digits="2"></span></p>
</div>

